  "description": {
    "raw": "Ice encrusts the ground, radiating supernatural cold and making it hard for creatures to maintain their balance. This icy ground is treated as normal ice, forcing creatures to spend 2 squares of movement to enter an icy square and increasing the DC of Acrobatics checks in the area by 5. A creature that begins its turn in the affected area takes 1d6 points of cold damage and takes a –2 penalty on saving throws against spells with the cold descriptor for 1 round.",
    "search_text": "\"ice encrusts the ground, radiating supernatural cold and making it hard for creatures to maintain their balance. this icy ground is treated as normal ice, forcing creatures to spend 2 squares of movement to enter an icy square and increasing the dc of acrobatics checks in the area by 5. a creature that begins its turn in the affected area takes 1d6 points of cold damage and takes a –2 penalty on saving throws against spells with the cold descriptor for 1 round.\"",
